| Client-only UI state  | Zustand             | Context        |
-->

## Gotchas

<!-- Non-obvious things that have actually bitten agents or new teammates.
     Add here when an agent makes the same mistake twice. -->
- <e.g. "Tests share a DB; run with `--runInBand` or they flake.">
- <e.g. "`config/legacy.ts` is still imported by billing — don't delete it.">

## Boundaries

- Always: <e.g. add/adjust tests for behavior you change>
- Ask first: <e.g. adding dependencies, DB migrations, changing public APIs, deleting files>
- Never: <e.g. commit secrets or `.env`; edit `generated/`; delete or skip failing tests to get green; push to `main`>

## Git & PRs

<!-- Only if you have conventions. Delete otherwise. -->
- Branches: `<type>/<ticket>-<slug>`. Commits: <Conventional Commits / other>.
- PR description: what changed, why, how it was tested.

## More context (read only when relevant)

<!-- Progressive disclosure: point to deeper docs with a trigger, instead of pasting them here.
     Keep to ≤10 links. These are read on demand, so they cost nothing until needed. -->
- Touching auth or sessions → read `docs/agents/auth.md`
- Adding a DB migration → read `docs/agents/migrations.md`
- Working inside `services/<x>/` → that folder has its own AGENTS.md